+| scope | pre-rename hits |
+|---|---|
+| v6/sprefa-store/ (js + rust) | 96 |
+| v6/tsv2/ | 1632 |
+| v6/prolog/ | 417 |
+
+These are dominated by generated byte-golden artifacts (`gen_emitted/`,
+`compile/out/`) holding `"__support_count"` / `__support_next_*` SQL
+identifiers and the `supportSql` JSON key (thousands of hits).
+
+Classification of every identified rename target:
