+### String-literal-keep (emitted / golden, NOT renamed, byte-identical now)
+
+- `"__support_count"` SQL column — lower.pl emitted literal (lower.pl:711,2316,2319,2322,2331,2351,2428,2432,3188).
+- `__support_next_<rel>` TEMP table name — lower.pl `ref_count_table_name/2` emitted literal (kept `'__support_next_~w'`).
