+- `v6/tsv2/gen_served/*` — untracked runtime-generated cache (not in git); emitted literals still `__support_count`/`supportSql`.
+- `gen_emitted/` + `compile/out/` — byte-golden generated modules (7915 residual "support" hits,
+  of which 3811 are `__support_*`); must not change (this is the hard constraint). Left untouched.
